</script>
										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791475851404_582809103434380736_568174540165810821", {"feature":"582809103434380736","feature2":"568174540165810821","owner":"103582791475851404","commentthreadid":"659456870","total_count":24,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":56905134,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":5186030,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"568174540165897612":{"text":"First that's not how AI assisted game development works, and honestly I am tired of seeing you guys like go find some other fake outrage to be angry about or actually care about the real issues like the debt bomb in the US economy built by the AI stack that is getting its ass beat by Chinese AI.","author":"UndeadBulwark"},"568174540165906992":{"text":"[quote=UndeadBulwark;568174540165897612]First that's not how AI assisted game development works, and honestly I am tired of seeing you guys like go find some other fake outrage to be angry about or actually care about the real issues like the debt bomb in the US economy built by the AI stack that is getting its ass beat by Chinese AI. [\/quote]\n\nnot that deep buddy, i see AI i skip it, simple as that\n\nwould never pay for lazy \"work\"","author":"Qtael"},"568174540165917275":{"text":"[quote=Qtael;568174540165906992][quote=UndeadBulwark;568174540165897612]First that's not how AI assisted game development works, and honestly I am tired of seeing you guys like go find some other fake outrage to be angry about or actually care about the real issues like the debt bomb in the US economy built by the AI stack that is getting its ass beat by Chinese AI. [\/quote]\n\nnot that deep buddy, i see AI i skip it, simple as that\n\nwould never pay for lazy \"work\" [\/quote]\nYou know what you're right you do you,","author":"UndeadBulwark"},"568174730608149767":{"text":"Get ready to skip everything. May want to start looking for that patch of woods you'll be living in soon. Start collecting sticks to eat with.","author":"JiggleBill"},"568174730608154654":{"text":"[quote=JiggleBill;568174730608149767]Get ready to skip everything. May want to start looking for that patch of woods you'll be living in soon. Start collecting sticks to eat with. [\/quote]\nCalm down goofy","author":"Qtael"},"568175523960761676":{"text":"[quote=JiggleBill;568174730608149767]Get ready to skip everything. May want to start looking for that patch of woods you'll be living in soon. Start collecting sticks to eat with. [\/quote]\nIf the aisludge of slopfest is what's going to be skipped, nobody is going to bat an eye.","author":"fenixblue"},"568175523960762823":{"text":"Also keep in mind they slop created this garbage by copying the original creators game \"Tank Fu\" on steam. Nasty people. I have no problem with AI, If it is done in a manner that benefits the actual developer. This game is the opposite. There are things such as copying great mechanics for a game and there is straight off ripping off by using AI to advantage to have an earlier release as the original creator. Nasty practice and should be condemned.","author":"gluemchen|A place far far away"},"568175523960765106":{"text":"[quote=gluemchen|A place far far away;568175523960762823]Also keep in mind they slop created this garbage by copying the original creators game \"Tank Fu\" on steam. Nasty people. I have no problem with AI, If it is done in a manner that benefits the actual developer. This game is the opposite. There are things such as copying great mechanics for a game and there is straight off ripping off by using AI to advantage to have an earlier release as the original creator. Nasty practice and should be condemned. [\/quote]\nTank fu is a different game and I am pretty sure I saw them also put the game in r\/AIGameDev","author":"UndeadBulwark"},"568175523960789154":{"text":"[quote=Qtael]The whole game was generated by ai\u2026\n\nIf you didn\u2019t bother making it, I won\u2019t bother consuming and paying for it\n\nSimple as that [\/quote]\nim going to buy it now.","author":"Wayne_B"},"569301473354073464":{"text":"[quote=Wayne_B;568175523960789154][quote=Qtael]The whole game was generated by ai\u2026\n\nIf you didn\u2019t bother making it, I won\u2019t bother consuming and paying for it\n\nSimple as that [\/quote]\nim going to buy it now. [\/quote]\n\nYou deserve it","author":"Qtael"},"569301473354075428":{"text":"Gonna buy it too, AI is the future, every game developer should use AI tools to vastly increase their own productivity.","author":"\u2622Paradoxic Gamer\u2622"},"569301473354083222":{"text":"[quote=\u2622Paradoxic Gamer\u2622;569301473354075428]Gonna buy it too, AI is the future, every game developer should use AI tools to vastly increase their own productivity. [\/quote]\nI tried AI Game Dev and holy fucking shit so much of the tedious stuff can be passed onto an AI its amazing and I am using a local model with 256k context.","author":"UndeadBulwark"},"569301473354104561":{"text":"[quote=UndeadBulwark;569301473354083222][quote=\u2622Paradoxic Gamer\u2622;569301473354075428]Gonna buy it too, AI is the future, every game developer should use AI tools to vastly increase their own productivity. [\/quote]\nI tried AI Game Dev and holy fucking shit so much of the tedious stuff can be passed onto an AI its amazing and I am using a local model with 256k context. [\/quote]\nTediuos stuff is what makes the art amazing\n\nlook at Wildwood, it took them 16 years to animate it with their hands, and it's the best stop motion movie i've watched ever and it will become a classic \n\nToo many shortcuts lead to dry results","author":"Qtael"},"569301473354108901":{"text":"[quote=JiggleBill;568174730608149767]Get ready to skip everything. May want to start looking for that patch of woods you'll be living in soon. Start collecting sticks to eat with. [\/quote]\n\nYou DO realize a ton of gamers only play older games made before AI existed, right? That and tons of indie devs despise AI taking their jobs and ruining games. There will always be anti AI games made. True artists tend to hate AI devaluing their work.","author":"MJay624"},"569301473354131067":{"text":"[quote=MJay624;569301473354108901][quote=JiggleBill;568174730608149767]Get ready to skip everything. May want to start looking for that patch of woods you'll be living in soon. Start collecting sticks to eat with. [\/quote]\n\nYou DO realize a ton of gamers only play older games made before AI existed, right? That and tons of indie devs despise AI taking their jobs and ruining games. There will always be anti AI games made. True artists tend to hate AI devaluing their work. [\/quote]\nThis is the exact same sh*t that was said about \"Real\" art and Digital art guess who won.","author":"UndeadBulwark"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
