			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_568175523960762823">
				Also keep in mind they slop created this garbage by copying the original creators game &quot;Tank Fu&quot; on steam. Nasty people. I have no problem with AI, If it is done in a manner that benefits the actual developer. This game is the opposite. There are things such as copying great mechanics for a game and there is straight off ripping off by using AI to advantage to have an earlier release as the original creator. Nasty practice and should be condemned.			</div>
